          "settings": {
            "category": "Implementation & Deployment",
            "question": "What infrastructure changes are required in our stores?",
            "answer": "Minimal physical infrastructure changes. Requirements: (1) Network: PoE-capable switches with 100Mbps per camera, VLAN segmentation recommended. (2) Power: Existing PoE provides camera power—no new electrical work. (3) Mounting: Ceiling-mounted cameras use standard drop-ceiling brackets or drywall anchors. No structural modifications. (4) Server: Edge processing unit (compact, fanless) mounts in existing server rack or wall-mount bracket. Dimensions: 30cm × 20cm × 5cm. (5) Internet: 10Mbps upload minimum for cloud sync. Most stores require no construction—installation is non-invasive. Site survey confirms requirements before contract.",
            "default_open": false,
